{"id":1030104,"chapter_id":1030104,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"抱歉局长，我们还是没能查到白逸背后的情报。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你坐在办公桌前，情报人员正向你汇报这几天的工作。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"不用着急。这项工作可能会持续很久，保持耐心，总会有所进展的。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"局长……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"情报员面露难色。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"会不会，白逸真的就像情报里所说的那样，只是个相对普通的禁闭者。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"所有传闻和证词都相互印证，就连您经历的事情也是。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"除了军团那些莽夫，她并没有跟任何大组织有勾连。如果她真有什么秘密，不可能毫无破绽。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"不，你忽略了一些东西。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"突袭假冒的白记实业那天，他们的老板说过，有一个神秘人给了他启动资金和狂厄武器。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"而对方的条件只有一个——就是要他以白记的名义在辛迪加扎根。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"可这是他的一面之词，不足以证明……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"如果只有这些，当然不够。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"但最有趣的是白逸的反应——。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"白逸的反应？","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"你觉得以之前的表现，白逸是那种会对“白记实业”的名声上心的人吗？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"那个藏在暗处的势力设下这个阳谋，摆下如此明显的局。他们的目标除了白逸，还能有谁？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"白逸上钩了，这或许是她与那个敌对势力的某种默契。但她没有毫无准备地赴约，而是利用了我，利用了整个MBCC的力量。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"居然是这样……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"白老板的演技很好，但她太心急了，急于向我表现自己是个人畜无害的废柴。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"在戳穿她之前，就陪她继续演下去吧。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"局长！就在刚刚，情报机构确定了瑞德·白的信息。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"那个冒名顶替白逸的人？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"是的。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"瑞德·白，新城人。半年前破产后失踪。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"刚刚我们收到了线人消息，有跟他很像的人出现在最靠近锈河的萨特街，很有可能正打算逃回新城。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"他那副体型在辛迪加可不常见，情报应该不会出错。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"看来戳穿白逸的机会到了——组织人手，准备抓捕。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"还没出来吗？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"你和MBCC的一整队行动人员已经埋伏了三个小时。但负责盯梢的人还是没有发来任何消息。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"偷渡新城的“航班”二十分钟后就要结束了。现在不走，可就要等到下周了……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"如果不是情报有误，会不会是出意外状况了。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"需要进行地毯式搜捕吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"以我们的人手数量，地毯式搜捕很可能会有漏网之鱼。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"……再等十分钟，如果目标还不出现就直接行动。优先搜捕旅馆、饭店这些地方。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"明白。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"局长，时间到了。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"十分钟后，依旧没有任何动静。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"不能再等了……行动吧。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"是！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"精干的MBCC的行动人员以极高的效率行动起来。两队人封住了街区的主要出口，另外几队则开始搜捕之前所说的重点区域。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"仅仅过去两分钟，行动人员就发来了消息。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"局长，地区7-4号街道，我们找到目标了！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"守住那里，我马上过去！","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"情报人员","content":"就是这里！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"你推开被破门锤摧毁的房门，一片狼藉当即映入眼帘。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"橱柜和桌子被打坏，就连床都被劈掉了一个角。除此之外，你还看到了可疑的血迹。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"房间的正中央，“白老板”被反捆在一把椅子上，嘴上被贴着胶带，眼角挂着泪痕，早已不省人事。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"上次见他的时候也是这样……","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"局长，我们在房间里还发现了这个。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"行动人员递来一个塑封袋，里面装着一台小型DV机。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"options":["打开DV机"],"style":6,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104052,"trial_step":52,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"打开DV机","goto":53}]},{"step":53,"content":"你打开塑封袋，摁下打开的按钮，然后点下了视频记录。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"一张惊恐的胖脸瞬间挤满了屏幕。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"他他他他他他们想害我！！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"果然辛迪加没一个好东西，又是给钱又是给货，就是想把我当刀使！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"现在被差佬盯上了，他们就想灭口。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"我我我我一定要把这些记录下来，就算我死了，也要把这个交给当差的……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"大大大大哥大姐，不论你是谁，为了狄斯城的正义，一定要替我报仇啊……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"101","content":"倒是有点小聪明，可惜他小看了追击自己的人。","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"101","content":"这些人既不可能漏过这么明显的一部DV机，也不可以因为一部小小的视频就退缩。","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"101","content":"而且他也高看了自己，一个毫无身份地位的人，即便遇害，也激不起任何波澜。","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"视频继续播放着。“白老板”在床上翻来覆去，压得床吱呀作响。过了好一会儿都没有别的影像。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"options":["按下快进"],"style":6,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104064,"trial_step":64,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"按下快进","goto":65}]},{"step":65,"content":"视频中的时间飞速流逝。很快，窗外出现了一阵怪异的响动。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"谁？！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"“白老板”吓得一激灵，快速起身来到床边拿起DV机。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"他一步步走向窗边，试图看清楚究竟是什么发出了怪响。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"一道黑影闪出，速度太快以至在影像里留下残影，你甚至看不清他的动作。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"“白老板”","content":"啊啊啊呜呜呜……","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"DV机被打飞掉落到墙角。镜头朝着黑漆漆的墙皮，但声音依然在继续。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"叮——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"那是武器相撞的清脆声响，看来有人阻止了袭击者。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我就猜你们会沉不住气。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"？？？","content":"谁给你们的胆子，敢主动挑衅我？","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"袭击者没有回应。你只听到武器破空的尖利声响。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"但这声响没有持续多久，很快，房间又安静下来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"视频到这里就结束了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"局长，现在该怎么办？","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"101","content":"先把瑞德·白控制起来。另外，窗口应该有血迹。","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"101","content":"循着血迹，追。","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"明白！","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"行动队以最快的速度出动，携带着光谱仪，循着血迹开始追捕。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"很快，你们抵达了一处暗巷。这里有明显的打斗痕迹。再往前，黑暗掩盖住了一切。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"浓厚的黑暗莫名激起了你心中的不安。你停下了脚步，犹豫着是否要让手下继续追击。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我是你的话，到这里就不会再追下去了。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"耳边传来熟悉的声音。与此同时，巷子里刮起一股强烈的风。这风卷起尘土，叫人睁不开眼。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我很喜欢你，也很欣赏你的勇气。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不过有些事情，光有勇气是没法解决的。","voice":["vo_trial_30104_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130104089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"你只听到声音，却看不到说话者的身影。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":1301040